# This file becomes the PUBLIC treedger-agent repository's ROOT .gitignore at move time
# (40-CONTEXT.md D-04). The Nuitka build-output directories below are excluded because they
# carry no source-review value — a multi-gigabyte compiled tree adds nothing a reader of this
# public, audit-first repository could ever want to inspect (D-01), and committing it would
# make every clone enormous for no benefit.

# Python bytecode / caches
# No trailing slash on __pycache__ (see note below on the Nuitka patterns): a
# directory-only pattern only matches when git can already see the path is a directory
# on disk, so the un-slashed form also matches a not-yet-created __pycache__ path.
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Nuitka --standalone build output (never --onefile, see agent/packaging/github-workflows/)
# No trailing slash: these directories do not exist yet on a fresh checkout, and a
# directory-only pattern (trailing "/") only matches a path git can already see is a
# directory on disk — so the un-slashed form is used deliberately, to also match before
# the directory has ever been created.
*.build
*.dist
*.onefile-build
*.exe

# CI-produced test/verification reports (regenerated on every run, not source)
report.xml
dpapi-report.xml
